      "text": "t6 - R2 (last reader of A) closes  =>  A.refcnt == 0.\nA is superseded AND oldest  =>\ncloseFilesAndRemove(f1, f2).\n<< FILES PHYSICALLY DELETED HERE (grace period over) >>",
