      "seed": 72,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 78,
      "roundness": null,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Epoch-Based Reclamation (EBR)  - crossbeam-epoch (Rust)\nRCU grace period              - Linux kernel, liburcu\nHazard pointers               - the Load->pin->re-Load acquire\nMVCC oldest-reader watermark  - MDBX/LMDB freelist\n                                (page freed at txn T reusable\n                                 once oldest reader > T),\n                                Postgres VACUUM, InnoDB purge",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Epoch-Based Reclamation (EBR)  - crossbeam-epoch (Rust)\nRCU grace period              - Linux kernel, liburcu\nHazard pointers               - the Load->pin->re-Load acquire\nMVCC oldest-reader watermark  - MDBX/LMDB freelist\n                                (page freed at txn T reusable\n                                 once oldest reader > T),\n                                Postgres VACUUM, InnoDB purge",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 10
    },
